.vercel
.env*
# Committed on purpose. Every value in it points at a local emulator, fake or
# throwaway container, so there is nothing secret to leak — and the integration
# suite cannot run without it. Never add a real credential to this file.
!.env.test
# Committed on purpose. It has blank values only; the TEST keys go in
# .env.paymob-sandbox.local, which the rule above keeps out.
!.env.paymob-sandbox.example
